 icon-1x1-xsmall"></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium">Claude website builder</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a data-doc="how-to-connect-the-relume-publish-mcp" href="#" class="features_chip w-inline-block"><div aria-hidden="true" data-icon="&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; &gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M14 9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6l-4 4V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11l-4-4h-6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" class="features_icon icon-1x1-xsmall"></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium">ChatGPT website builder</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a data-doc="how-to-bring-a-relume-publish-project-into-figma" href="#" class="features_chip w-inline-block"><div aria-hidden="true" data-icon="&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; &gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M5 5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 8.5 2H12v7H8.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5 5.5z&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 2h3.5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 0 7H12V2z&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 12.5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 7 0 3.5 3.5 0 1 1-7 0z&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M5 19.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 8.5 16H12v3.5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-7 0z&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M5 12.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 8.5 9H12v7H8.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5 12.5z&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" class="features_icon icon-1x1-xsmall"></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium">Website to Figma</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
.features_icon svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.features_chip.is-soon,.features_chip.is-soon:hover{background-color:var(--_publish-colors---background--accent-subtle-opacity);border-color:var(--_publish-primitives---colors--pink-200);cursor:default}
.features_chip.is-soon .features_icon{background-color:var(--_publish-colors---background--secondary)}
.features_dot{animation:featuresPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes featuresPulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.35;transform:scale(.7)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.features_dot{animation:none}}
</style>
<script>
// Feature buttons (Publish Features CMS): add the icon SVG, link to the doc, and make Coming soon items non-clickable.
document.querySelectorAll('.section_features .features_chip').forEach(function(a){
  var icon=a.querySelector('.features_icon');
  var svg=icon&&icon.getAttribute('data-icon');
  if(svg&&/^\s*<svg[\s>]/i.test(svg)&&!/<script|\son\w+=/i.test(svg)){icon.innerHTML=svg;}
  var slug=a.getAttribute('data-doc');
  var badge=a.querySelector('.tag.is-soon');
  var soon=badge&&!badge.classList.contains('w-condition-invisible');
  if(slug&&!soon){a.href='/resources/publish/doc/'+slug;}
  else{a.removeAttribute('href');a.setAttribute('aria-disabled','true');a.classList.add('is-soon');}
});
